    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "stupid acronyms",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C0956538A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "We have to have all these stupid acronyms that describe things that nobody understands: OKRs and PIPs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "504676AEE9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "I think we can run our businesses by just talking to each other like regular human beings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC0B12E59B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "We might actually get more done. [The Way We Work] I really always wanted to be an HR professional, I wanted to be able to speak the language of management.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "464D115244",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "And you know what I've learned after all this time?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82D0A605AD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "I don't think any of it matters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C0DB648D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "There's all kinds of things that we call \"best practices\" that aren't best practices at all.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D86DB5612",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "How do we know it's best?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8A2546B4C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "We don't measure this stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "720AFB428B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "best practices",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FE9CA825BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "In fact, I've learned that \"best practices\" usually means copying what everybody else does.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "31E9C1DED4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Our world is changing and evolving all the time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F2D93973C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Here are some lessons to help you adapt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "63AC3E10D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Lesson one: Your employees are adults.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "54AC0F644B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "layers and so many processes and so many guidelines",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9AC9C203D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 155,
        "endOffset": 189,
        "text": "treat people like they're children",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A123D1C20",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 190,
        "text": "You know, we've created so many layers and so many processes and so many guidelines to keep those employees in place that we've ended up with systems that treat people like they're children.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "265EC0F5F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "And they're not.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2738539958",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Fully formed adults walk in the door every single day.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BF5799625",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "They have rent payments, they have obligations, they're members of society, they want to create a difference in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B04DEB56FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "So if we start with the assumption that everybody comes to work to do an amazing job, you'd be surprised what you get.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D94E7C2766",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "Lesson two: The job of management isn't to control people, it's to build great teams.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "32FBBAA5C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "When managers build great teams, here's how you know it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E96FA3FD2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "They've done amazing stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1225D8DC65",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "Customers are really happy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6478973B1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Those are the metrics that really matter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "699E7E7F88",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Not the metrics of: \"Do you come to work on time?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24A87A1452",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "\"Did you take your vacation?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D08C60B04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "\"Did you follow the rules?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28A0E48B53",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "\"Did you ask for permission?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7628B13E28",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Lesson three: People want to do work that means something.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7E58BFA127",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "After they do it, they should be free to move on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F04ED00A68",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "Careers are journeys.",
