        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 201,
        "text": "So let's rethink the word \"feedback,\" and think about it as telling people the truth, the honest truth, about what they're doing right and what they're doing wrong, in the moment when they're doing it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1207833467",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "you just did",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49B080BB8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "That good thing you just did, whoo!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CA0CE5431C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "That's exactly what I'm talking about.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1152CA788F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "Go do that again.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B606C8D22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "today, three more times",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA9EC1C6B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "And people will do that again, today, three more times.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E88963DE49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Your company",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D1CDE50F8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Lesson six: Your company needs to live out its values.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B28D4170A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "I was talking to a company not long ago, to the CEO.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "163F9D1BA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "He was having trouble because the company was rocky and things weren't getting done on time, and he felt like things were sloppy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "487F269727",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "This also was a man who, I observed, never showed up to any meeting on time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6C06E9C20",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 5,
        "text": "Ever.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8DE7DE3CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "you can do to \"uphold your values\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8BFB4EB0EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "If you're part of a leadership team, the most important thing that you can do to \"uphold your values\" is to live them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "326FBCF4AD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "People can't be what they can't see.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F6A86209C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "proudly pound our chest",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CA263E3FFE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "We say, \"Yes, we're here for equality,\" and then we proudly pound our chest because we'd achieved 30 percent representation of women on an executive team.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED070C1996",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Well that's not equal, that's 30 percent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "651D181B04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Lesson seven: All start-up ideas are stupid.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D078F7DEA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "I spend a lot of time with start-ups, and I have a lot of friends that work in larger, more established companies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "635056B6D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "pooh-poohing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4FD1A5C78E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 1,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "That is such a stupid idea.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E899722A26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "all start-up ideas are stupid",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "37BB199BE1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "If they were reasonable, somebody else would have already been doing them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68CF703A50",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "Lesson eight: Every company needs to be excited for change.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF5B726650",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Beware of the smoke of nostalgia.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "961AD9D20F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "If you find yourself saying, \"Remember the way it used to be?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26EA4AB6B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "I want you to shift your thinking to say, \"Think about the way it's going to be.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9A2FF9FCB6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "If I had a dream company, I would walk in the door and I would say, \"Everything's changed, all bets are off.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24433E8ED1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "running as fast as we can to the right, and now we'll take a hard left",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12FEC71CAE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And everybody would go \"Yes!\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2035886D45",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "It's a pretty exciting world out there, and it's changing all the time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5B0886C6AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "the more we embrace it and get excited about it, the more fun we're going to have",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B61D320653",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}